===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[calcium]] [[carbonate]]|-}}

# {{label|en|inorganic compound}} A [[colourless]] or [[white]] [[inorganic]] [[compound]], CaCO<sub>3</sub>, occurring as [[chalk]], [[limestone]], [[marble]] etc; reacts with [[acid]]s to liberate [[carbon dioxide]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|E170}} when used as a [[food colouring]]

